{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01KEQEUENjYjr7BwwqkLCoRK", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# Obsidian Changelog Summary\n\n## Most Recent Public Desktop Release\n\n**Version:** 1.13.7 Desktop  \n**Date:** August 12, 2026\n\n### Key Changes:\n- Fixed files with special characters not appearing in macOS vaults\n- Resolved inline math rendering issues in list items and callouts\n- Corrected image behavior in pop-out windows\n- Fixed CSS Snippet menu duplicate entries\n\n---\n\n## Newer Early Access (Catalyst) Versions\n\n**Version:** 1.14.4 Desktop (October 1, 2026)\n\nNotable additions include kanban improvements, enhanced search functionality across multiple views, and the ability to open files from outside the vault. Features added: \"Hide column\" option for kanban columns, better path matching in file searches, and support for external files in Outline and Outgoing links views."}]}, "timestamp": "2026-10-02T02:02:04.883Z", "tool_use_result": {"bytes": 75984, "code": 200, "codeText": "OK", "result": "# Obsidian Changelog Summary\n\n## Most Recent Public Desktop Release\n\n**Version:** 1.13.7 Desktop  \n**Date:** August 12, 2026\n\n### Key Changes:\n- Fixed files with special characters not appearing in macOS vaults\n- Resolved inline math rendering issues in list items and callouts\n- Corrected image behavior in pop-out windows\n- Fixed CSS Snippet menu duplicate entries\n\n---\n\n## Newer Early Access (Catalyst) Versions\n\n**Version:** 1.14.4 Desktop (October 1, 2026)\n\nNotable additions include kanban improvements, enhanced search functionality across multiple views, and the ability to open files from outside the vault. Features added: \"Hide column\" option for kanban columns, better path matching in file searches, and support for external files in Outline and Outgoing links views.", "durationMs": 4370, "url": "https://obsidian.md/changelog/"}}
